      Period: 96.4
      Orbit_Type: LEO > Low Earth Orbit > Polar Non-Sun-Synchronous
   End_Group
   Creation_Date: 2007-11-19
   Online_Resource: https://science.nasa.gov/missions/erbs
   Group: Platform_Logistics
      Launch_Date: 1984-10-05
      Launch_Site: Cape Canaveral/Kennedy Space Center, USA
      Primary_Sponsor: USA/NASA
   End_Group
End_Group"""@en,
