End_Group"""@en,
        "OSCAR description: 6th flight unit of the NOAA 4th generation programme, 3rd of the ATN series. Main mission: operational meteorology. Substantial contribution to Earth radiation study. Significant contribution to Atmospheric chemistry and Space weather."@en,
