      Period: 1440.0 minutes
      Perigee: 35788.0 km
      Apogee: 35788.0 km
      Orbit_Type: GEO > GEOSYNCHRONOUS > GEOSTATIONARY
   End_Group
   Creation_Date: 2007-10-04
   Online_Resource: http://www.oso.noaa.gov/goes/
