      Short_Name: NSCAT
      Short_Name: IMG
      Short_Name: ILAS
      Short_Name: AVNIR
   End_Group
   Group: Orbit
      Orbit_Inclination: 98.6 degrees
      Period: 101 minutes
      Perigee: 797 km
      Orbit_Type: LEO > Low Earth Orbit > Polar Sun-Synchronous
   End_Group
   Creation_Date: 2007-08-22
   Online_Resource: http://global.jaxa.jp/projects/sat/adeos/index.html
