        "OSCAR description: 1st flight unit of the ADEOS programme. Main missions: ocean observation, land observation and atmospheric chemistry."@en,
        "OSOidx functionOfSpaceObject: The purposes of ADEOS are to verify functions and performance of two NASDA sensors: Ocean Color and Temperature Scanner (OCTS) and Advanced Visible and Near-Infrared Radiometer (AVNIR), and to provide the Earth observation data. (see reg. document for ful"@en ;
