    schema:name "DIWATA-1"@en ;
    mac:description """OSOidx functionOfSpaceObject: 1.  Assess the extent of damages associated with disasters. 2.  Observe surface features for agriculture, forestry, urban management, disaster response, and natural and cultural heritage applications.3.  Capture images to derive geophysical parameters for agriculture, forestry and fishery using selective multispectral capability.
