   End_Group
   Group: Synonymous_Platform_Names
      Short_Name: IMAGE
   End_Group
   Group: Platform_Associated_Instruments
      Short_Name: UVI
   End_Group
   Creation_Date: 2007-11-20
   Online_Resource: http://image.gsfc.nasa.gov/
   Sample_Image: http://image.gsfc.nasa.gov/image/image_launch_a5.jpg
   Group: Platform_Logistics
      Launch_Date: 2000-03-25
      Launch_Site: Vandenberg Air Force Base, USA
      Primary_Sponsor: NASA
   End_Group
End_Group"""@en,
        "OSCAR description: Single flight unit of the IMAGE programme. Also known as Explorer 78. Main mission: magnetosphere/ionosphere processes. Highly elliptical orbit (perigee 1,000 km, apogee 46,000 km, quadratic average 6,782 km)."@en,
