    mac:description "CEOS applications: The long-term meteorological programme of the US Department of Defense (DoD) - with the objective to collect and disseminate worldwide cloud cover data on a daily basis. The mission is now operational past the design life."@en,
        "OSCAR description: 16th flight unit of the DMSP Block 5D series, 2nd of the Block 5D-3 series. Main missions: cloud imagery and MW imaging/temperature/humidity sounding. Substantial contribution to Space weather."@en,
