      Design_Life: Greater than 2 years
      Primary_Sponsor: USA/NASA
      Primary_Sponsor: USA/NOAA
   End_Group
End_Group"""@en,
        "OSCAR description: 4th flight unit of NOAA 5th generation. Main mission: operational meteorology. Significant contribution to atmospheric chemistry and space weather."@en,
