      Design_Life: 3 years
      Primary_Sponsor: USA/NASA
      Primary_Sponsor: FRANCE/CNES
      Primary_Sponsor: Alcatel
   End_Group
End_Group"""@en,
        "OSCAR description: Single flight unit of the CALIPSO programme. Main missions: cloud and aerosol profiling."@en,
        "OSOidx functionOfSpaceObject: CALIPSO is part of the A-Train formation, which also includes the National Aeronautics and Space Administration (NASA) Aqua and Aura satellites, the NASA/Canadian Space Agency CloudSat satellite and the Centre national détudes spatiales (CNES) Parasol satellite."@en,
        "UCS Purpose: Earth Science"@en,
        "UCS Users: Government"@en ;
