    mac:description "CEOS applications: Meteorology, climatology. Due to a hardware problem on the Metop-B satellite, the A-DCS3 instrument is only supporting an ARGOS-2 service."@en,
        """GCMD definitions: [Text Source: ESA MetOp Meteorological Missions Homepage, http://www.esa.int/esaLP/SEMN1FAATME_LPmetop_0.html ]

MetOp-B, the second satellite in the series,launched on 17 September 2012 and will operate in tandem with MetOp-A, increasing the wealth of data even further. The third and final satellite, MetOp-C will be launched in 2016.

Launching a new satellite every 5–6 years guarantees a continuous delivery of high-quality data for medium- and long-term weather forecasting and climate monitoring until at least 2020.


