eor:satellite.2016-064A a eo-ont:Satellite ;
    rdfs:label "HIMAWARI-9"@en ;
    schema:alternateName "41836"@en,
        "Himawari 9"@en,
        "Himawari-9"@en ;
    schema:name "HIMAWARI-9"@en ;
    mac:description "CEOS applications: Meteorology, environmental monitoring, data collection platform"@en,
        """GCMD definitions: Himawari 9 is the second of two third-generation satellites in Japan’s Himawari weather-monitoring series. Alongside Himawari 8, which was launched in October 2014, it is expected to provide the Japan Meteorological Agency (JMA) and the Ministry of Transport with observational data into the late 2020s

Facts in Brief
Launch Date: 2016-11-02
Launch Vehicle: H-2A
