    schema:name "FENGYUN 2H"@en ;
    mac:description "CEOS applications: Meteorology and environmental monitoring; data collection and redistribution."@en,
        "OSCAR description: 8th (last) flight unit of the FY-2 series. Mission: operational meteorology. Significant contribution to Space weather."@en,
        """OSOidx functionOfSpaceObject: To obtain daytime visible-light, day and
night infrared cloud imagery and
water-vapour distribution maps; transmit
extended cloud imagery for use by
domestic and foreign ground data stations;
gather observation data from
data-collection platforms of meteorological,
marine and hydrological agencies; monitor
space environments; and obtain monitoring
data for satellite engineering and space
environmental-science research
"""@en,
        "UCS Purpose: Earth Observation"@en,
        "UCS Users: Government"@en,
        "UCS detailedPurpose: Meteorology"@en ;
