eor:satellite.2018-111AH a eo-ont:Satellite ;
    rdfs:label "ZACUBE-2"@en ;
    schema:alternateName "ZA-004"@en,
        "ZACube-2"@en ;
    schema:name "ZACUBE-2"@en ;
    mac:description "CEOS applications: ZACube-2 is equipped with an automatic identification system (AIS) receiver to demonstrate AIS message reception using its SDR-based payload. Additionally, ZACube-2 has a near-infrared imager for forest fire detection."@en,
        """OSOidx functionOfSpaceObject: ZaCube-2 is a technology demonstrator mission and is equipped with an Automatic Identification System (AIS) receiver as its main payload through which navigational data is received. 
