    mac:description "OSCAR description: Second satellite of EDRS  Provides timely data access to European EO satellites (e.g. Sentinels) Contributes to space weather"@en,
        "OSOidx functionOfSpaceObject: EDRS-C (European Data Relay Satellite C) is one component of the European data relay system. The EDRS's two telecommunication payloads in geostationary orbit will enable broadband, bi-directional data relay between Low Earth Orbit (LEO) satellites and an associated ground segment via either of the EDRS payloads."@en,
        "UCS Purpose: Communications"@en,
