    schema:name "GHGSAT-C1"@en ;
    mac:description "GCMD definitions: In order to expand satellite system capacity after the successful launch of its demonstration satellite, GHGSat started the design of two (2) additional high-resolution satellites in January 2017, called GHGSat-C1 ('Iris') and GHGSat-C2 ('Hugo'), respectively. GHGSat-C1/-C2 are intended to have similar designs to GHGSat-D, while applying critical lessons learned to improve performance."@en,
