    schema:name "MDASAT-1B"@en ;
    mac:description "CEOS applications: The MDASat-1 constellation is equipped with an improved automatic identification system (AIS) receiver from its predecessor, ZACube-2, using its SDR-based payload. MDASat-1 can receive messages on the AIS and AIS long range channels. Currently, MDASAT-1B can only be controlled and operated when in failsafe mode due to an issue with the SDR payload."@en,
