    mac:description "OSCAR description: First satellite of CNSA L-Band SARs Major contribution to land observation Major contribution to disaster monitoring"@en,
        "OSOidx functionOfSpaceObject: Operating in a sun-synchronous dawn-dusk orbit, the LT-1 satellites are designed mainly for differential surface deformation measurement tasks, featuring single-satellite SAR imaging and dual-satellite interferometric altimetry functions, capable of working in an all-weather, all-day, multi-mode and multi-polarization manner, and are mainly used for land and resources surveys, as well as early identification, monitoring and early warning of geological disasters, etc."@en,
