        "SuperView Neo-2 01"@en ;
    schema:name "SUPERVIEW NEO-2 01"@en ;
    mac:description "OSCAR description: Third Flight unit of the SuperView Neo constellation. Main mission: high-resolution land observation, disaster monitoring."@en,
        "OSOidx functionOfSpaceObject: Aside from providing global remote sensing satellite base products with high precision and wide swath, to meet market demands, the satellite also offers value-added products, information products and spatio-temporal information service solutions, and has become a leader in China's remote sensing satellite services in traditional industries such as natural resources, surveying and mapping, ocean, environmental protection and emergency response. It is also serving China's emerging markets including for 3D real-scene models, urban security, \"digital twin\" system for river basins, urban information models, digital countryside, financial agriculture and autonomous driving, thus promoting the healthy development of China's digital economy."@en,
        "UCS Purpose: Earth Observation"@en,
        "UCS Users: Commercial"@en,
        "UCS detailedPurpose: Radar Imaging"@en ;
